{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"\"Content as structure, intent, logic...\"\n      RLHF · SFT · output evaluation\n      Qorvatech, 2023 — SEO architecture\n      \"AI depends on human judgement\"\n      ask anchal anything\n    \n    \n      01 · MOST DEFENSIBLE FOR HER BRAND\n      The Self-Reading Portfolio\n      RAG · Agentic\n      WebGPU shader field\n      2026 hybrid AI+UI trend\n      The portfolio IS an LLM trained on her own writing. You don't navigate sections — you ask. \"Show me her LLM-evaluation work\" pulls real fragments of her writing into a 3D semantic field, with citations back to projects. Behind it: real embeddings, real RAG, real grounding.\n      Why this is the unlock: her work is literally about making AI outputs accurate, structured, and trustworthy. A portfolio that demonstrates that skill by being an aligned AI product is unbeatable positioning. No content strategist on the web has shipped this yet.\n      \n        StackNext.js · R3F · WebGPU shader · pgvector/Pinecone · Vercel AI SDK · Claude Haiku\n        ReferenceHybrid AI-chat + spatial UI trend · 2026 interface essay\n        Build~3 weeks · medium-high effort · highest payoff","choice":"rag","id":null,"timestamp":1778065048613}
